@startuml state-approval
title AdVerity review-ready ad pack — Version state
footer CONFIDENTIAL — Internal use only · (c) HARA Solutions Limited & HealthCrew.ai

[*] --> NeedsInput : evidence or confirmation missing
[*] --> ModelUnavailable : adapter failure
[*] --> ValidationFailed : count or required assets failed
[*] --> ReadyForExpert : validator passed

ValidationFailed --> ReadyForExpert : one repair produces a new version that passes
ReadyForExpert --> ExpertApproved : copy expert approves this content_hash
ExpertApproved --> AwaitingLanguage : expert cannot assess the locale
ExpertApproved --> ExportEligible : route approver approves this content_hash\nand language review is not required
AwaitingLanguage --> ExportEligible : language reviewer and route approver\nboth approved this content_hash

ReadyForExpert --> PendingApprover : route approver unassigned
PendingApprover --> ReadyForExpert : approver assignment stored

ExportEligible --> Superseded : text, offer, locale, or destination edit
ExpertApproved --> Superseded : text, offer, locale, or destination edit
ReadyForExpert --> ReadyForExpert : comment only
ExportEligible --> ExportEligible : comment only

Superseded --> [*] : a new version starts the pipeline
@enduml
